      "K0",
      "K1"
     ]
    ],
    "what": "L0 and L1 ship a .gitignore that already excludes .env, .env.* (except .env.example) and appsettings.*.local.json (L0 .gitignore:13-17, L1 :14-18). M, M1, K0 and K1 ship none; their project-structure skills create one during scaffolding (M SKILL:28/:62, M1/K1 solution-layout tree, K0 solution-layout.md:66-68 naming 'local secret/config overrides'). Same rule; only whether the ignore file exists before scaffolding differs. A secret in a tracked file is caught by none of the six mechanically.",
